“I do,” or “We’d like to buy your screenplay” can bind us, condemn us, or bring us joy. 
They can hurt or heal us ²ir magi c power. The healing power  of words ·ir 
most magical aspect. Writers, ặ sham ans or medicine men and women of ancient 
