ºS AND SHAMANS  
Shamans č called “the wounded healers. ” Like writers, ý special people 
set apart ¼ rest Çir dreams, vi sions, or unique experiences. Shamans, like 
many writers, are prepared ¹ir work by enduring terrible ordeals. They ơ a 
dangerous illness or fall from a cliff and have nearly every bone broken. ầ chewed 
