Often those chosen to be shamans are identi fied by special dreams or visions, æ 
the gods or spirits take them away to other worlds where they under go terrible ordeals. 
ầ laid out on a table to have őir bones removed and broken. Before their 
eyes, their bones and organs are split, cooked, and reassembled in a new order. ầ 
tuned to a new frequency like radio receivers. As shamans, ý now able to receive 
messages from other worlds.  
